# tax-web — core

- Public Vite + React 19 + TypeScript frontend for Taiwan individual income tax guidance; details in root `AGENTS.md`.
- **User-facing strings**: Traditional Chinese (zh-TW) unless the product adds another locale.
- **Tax numbers and brackets**: use `src/data/numbers_2026.json` via `src/lib/numbers.ts` (or existing content); do not invent rates, thresholds, or filing dates.
- After meaningful logic or schema changes, prefer running `pnpm test` and `pnpm lint`.
- Do not commit private research text or paste it into public issues/PRs.
- Optional maintainer-only paths for the private `tax` repo belong in root **`AGENTS.local.md`** (gitignored); see **`AGENTS.md`** for policy.
